msgstr "Zahlungsseite: Xaman-API-Key"

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:93
msgid "The public API key of your Xaman developer app (apps.xaman.dev). With it, customers on a phone get an \"Open in wallet app\" button. Never the API secret."
msgstr "Der öffentliche API-Key Ihrer Xaman-Entwickler-App (apps.xaman.dev). Damit bekommen Kunden am Handy einen Button \"In Wallet-App öffnen\". Niemals das API-Secret."

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:98
msgid "Payment page: WalletConnect project id"
msgstr "Zahlungsseite: WalletConnect-Projekt-ID"

#: includes/admin/class-ledger-direct-admin.php:100
msgid "The project id from cloud.walletconnect.com, if you want to offer WalletConnect wallets. Public, like the Xaman key."
msgstr "Die Projekt-ID von cloud.walletconnect.com, wenn Sie WalletConnect-Wallets anbieten wollen. Öffentlich, wie der Xaman-Key."

